 =?UTF-8?q?nowledgment=20('Nice=20=E2=80=94=20you=20had=20the=20beef=20ste?=
 =?UTF-8?q?w.')=20instead=20of=20macro=20praise=20that=20could=20land=20on?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20the=20wrong=20macro?=
